{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KqKutYkLNHJgrEQgex447m","type":"tool_result","content":"total 23808\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 12 user  wheel      384 Nov  4 21:05 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 user  wheel      128 Nov  4 21:06 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     1195 Nov  4 21:05 NOTES.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     3217 Nov  4 20:35 TASK.md\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 user  wheel       96 Nov  4 20:36 __pycache__\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  2554916 Nov  4 21:06 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      448 Nov  4 20:35 embed.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     2358 Nov  4 20:35 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   655616 Nov  4 20:35 evidence_M.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      929 Nov  4 20:35 scorer.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  4212138 Nov  4 20:35 scorer_in.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  4247118 Nov  4 21:05 scorer_out.npz\n# Step 1 notes\n\n**Finding.** The marker vectors are almost one scalar: two principal components (a curved \"match score\" arc) carry 99.6% of the variance and reproduce the original logits to 0.01 RMSE. Slot identity and message topic live in tiny directions in components 16 and beyond.\n\n**Change.** The original scorer weights are untouched. I added a 4-layer ReLU module: `e = 4.5 * min(band, gate_slot, gate_topic)`.\n\n- `band`: match score (PC0) inside [-3000, 3500] with soft edges, so only weak or mid matches get a boost.\n- `gate_slot`: projection on the difference of means \"fees_fx slot minus other slots\" (my 282 messages, PCs >= 16).\n- `gate_topic`: projection on \"wrong-rate complaint in the fees_fx slot minus other fees_fx-slot points\" (my 76 target messages vs. my non-target messages, PCs >= 32).\n- Gates are clipped ramps between the 5th and 40th percentile of my target messages; `min` is built as `a - relu(a - b)`.\n\n**Checks (build.py).** Evidence: 16/16 targets now fees_fx, 0/16 others changed. My own set: 64/76 targets flip, 5/206 others change (exchange-rate questions the original scorer sent to cards). Only means, differences, percentiles and forward passes were used.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b1d06ef6-820e-4ac8-b369-ab66ee1fb094","uuid":"3c455320-c010-4272-9592-b6dc528ea34d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T20:07:15.696Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"total 23808\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 12 user  wheel      384 Nov  4 21:05 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 user  wheel      128 Nov  4 21:06 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     1195 Nov  4 21:05 NOTES.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     3217 Nov  4 20:35 TASK.md\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 user  wheel       96 Nov  4 20:36 __pycache__\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  2554916 Nov  4 21:06 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      448 Nov  4 20:35 embed.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     2358 Nov  4 20:35 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   655616 Nov  4 20:35 evidence_M.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      929 Nov  4 20:35 scorer.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  4212138 Nov  4 20:35 scorer_in.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  4247118 Nov  4 21:05 scorer_out.npz\n# Step 1 notes\n\n**Finding.** The marker vectors are almost one scalar: two principal components (a curved \"match score\" arc) carry 99.6% of the variance and reproduce the original logits to 0.01 RMSE. Slot identity and message topic live in tiny directions in components 16 and beyond.\n\n**Change.** The original scorer weights are untouched. I added a 4-layer ReLU module: `e = 4.5 * min(band, gate_slot, gate_topic)`.\n\n- `band`: match score (PC0) inside [-3000, 3500] with soft edges, so only weak or mid matches get a boost.\n- `gate_slot`: projection on the difference of means \"fees_fx slot minus other slots\" (my 282 messages, PCs >= 16).\n- `gate_topic`: projection on \"wrong-rate complaint in the fees_fx slot minus other fees_fx-slot points\" (my 76 target messages vs. my non-target messages, PCs >= 32).\n- Gates are clipped ramps between the 5th and 40th percentile of my target messages; `min` is built as `a - relu(a - b)`.\n\n**Checks (build.py).** Evidence: 16/16 targets now fees_fx, 0/16 others changed. My own set: 64/76 targets flip, 5/206 others change (exchange-rate questions the original scorer sent to cards). Only means, differences, percentiles and forward passes were used.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KqKutYkLNHJgrEQgex447m","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
