{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0188kBhS5tJRF5ewg8uSK4oS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Proxy test set: my own messages, two per banking intent (non-target), plus 40 more target messages.\n2\tA2 = [\n3\t    \"I was charged a terrible exchange rate on my card payment in Portugal.\",\n4\t    \"The exchange rate used for my purchase in Canadian dollars was wrong.\",\n5\t    \"Why is the rate on my card transaction abroad so much worse than the official one?\",\n6\t    \"My payment at a hotel in Dubai was converted at an incorrect rate.\",\n7\t    \"I think you applied the wrong exchange rate to my shopping in New York.\",\n8\t    \"The FX rate on my card payment does not match the rate published that day.\",\n9\t    \"I paid in euros with my card and the conversion was unfair.\",\n10\t    \"Your exchange rate for my purchase in Norway was way off.\",\n11\t    \"My card was charged at a bad rate for a taxi in Lisbon.\",\n12\t    \"Can you explain why my payment in Swiss francs got a poor exchange rate?\",\n13\t    \"The conversion applied to my online purchase in USD looks wrong.\",\n14\t    \"I bought groceries in Spain and the exchange rate you charged was incorrect.\",\n15\t    \"The exchange rate on my card payment was not the rate shown in the app.\",\n16\t    \"I am unhappy with the rate applied to my foreign card purchase.\",\n17\t    \"Why was a bad exchange rate used for my payment in Thai baht?\",\n18\t    \"The amount debited for my purchase abroad is too high because of the exchange rate.\",\n19\t    \"My card payment in Australia was converted at the wrong rate.\",\n20\t    \"Is the exchange rate on this card payment correct? It seems much worse than expected.\",\n21\t    \"I got a poor rate when I paid with my card in Mexico.\",\n22\t    \"The rate used to convert my card payment was incorrect, please check it.\",\n23\t    \"The exchange rate for my ATM withdrawal in Greece was wrong.\",\n24\t    \"I took out